# [[.Name]]

FastAPI service generated by `omni new service [[.Name]] --lang python`.

| Endpoint | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `GET /healthz` | liveness |
| `GET /readyz` | readiness; returns 503 once SIGTERM arrives, while uvicorn drains |
| `GET /metrics` | Prometheus request counts and latency histogram |
| `GET /v1/info` | service name and version |

```bash
make venv test   # create .venv, install pinned deps, run pytest
make run         # uvicorn on :[[.Port]]
make check       # omni check: ruff, pip-audit, secrets, Dockerfile, Kubernetes rules
```

Dependencies are pinned with `==` so `pip-audit` checks exactly what ships. The image
runs as UID 10001; `deploy/k8s.yaml` sets a read-only root filesystem, drops all
capabilities, and sets resource limits and probes.
